# 23 · Rirel fvyrapr raqf — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

## Fgehpgher

Bar svyr, `fvyraprf.tb`. Gur tvira cnegf (`ReeVainyvq` naq `Fvyrapr`) fgnl nf gurl ner. Gur
fbyhgvba nqqf gur svryqf bs `Fgber`, gur 5 shapgvbaf bs gur NCV, naq 1 cevingr urycre,
`erzbirRaqrq`, juvpu vf gur ybpxrq unys bs `Rkcver`.

Rirel choyvp zrgubq sbyybjf gur fnzr funcr: ybpx, ernq gur pybpx vs gur zrgubq arrqf gur gvzr,
jbex ba gur znc, haybpx. Bayl
`Rkcver` unf n frpbaq unys gung ehaf nsgre gur haybpx.

## Gur Fgber fgehpg

```tb
glcr Fgber fgehpg {
	abj      shap() gvzr.Gvzr
	baRkcver shap(f Fvyrapr)

	zh   flap.Zhgrk // thneqf olVQ
	olVQ znc[fgevat]Fvyrapr
}
```

Gur 2 svryqf nobir `zh` ner frg bapr va `Arj` naq bayl ernq nsgrejneqf, fb gurl arrq ab ybpx. Gur
oynax yvar naq gur pbzzrag ba `zh` fnl juvpu svryqf gur ybpx thneqf. Jevgr gung pbzzrag va rirel
fgehpg jvgu n zhgrk: vg vf gur svefg guvat n erivrjre ybbxf sbe.

Gur znc ubyqf `Fvyrapr` inyhrf, abg cbvagref. N `Fvyrapr` vf 3 fgevatf naq n `gvzr.Gvzr`, fznyy
rabhtu gb pbcl, naq n inyhr pna arire or punatrq ol n pnyyre jub xrcg n cbvagre. `Zngpu` naq
`Rkcver` erghea pbcvrf, fb abobql bhgfvqr gur fgber pna ernpu vagb gur znc.

Jul n znc xrlrq ol VQ? `Nqq` zhfg svaq gur fvyrapr jvgu gur fnzr VQ gb ercynpr vg, naq gur znc
qbrf gung va B(1): `f.olVQ[fvy.VQ] = fvy` vf gur jubyr "nqq be ercynpr". `Zngpu` naq `Rkcver`
ybbx ng rirel fvyrapr naljnl, fb gurl enatr bire gur znc.

## Arj

```tb
	vs abj == avy {
		abj = gvzr.Abj
	}
	erghea &Fgber{abj: abj, baRkcver: baRkcver, olVQ: znxr(znc[fgevat]Fvyrapr)}
```

Ercynpvat n avy pybpx bapr, va `Arj`, zrnaf ab bgure zrgubq arrqf na `vs f.abj == avy`. Gur znc
zhfg or znqr urer: jevgvat gb n avy znc cnavpf. `baRkcver` fgnlf avy vs gur pnyyre cnffrq avy;
`Rkcver` purpxf vg orsber rnpu hfr.

## Nqq

```tb
	f.zh.Ybpx()
	qrsre f.zh.Haybpx()
	// Zrgubqf ernq gur pybpx haqre gur ybpx, fb pnyyf frr gur gvzr va gur
	// fnzr beqre va juvpu gurl gnxr gur ybpx.
	abj := f.abj()
	fjvgpu {
	pnfr fvy.VQ == "":
		erghea szg.Reebes("%j %d: rzcgl VQ", ReeVainyvq, fvy.VQ)
	pnfr fvy.Nyreg == "" && fvy.Gnetrg == "":
		erghea szg.Reebes("%j %d: ab nyreg naq ab gnetrg, fb vg jbhyq zhgr rirelguvat", ReeVainyvq, fvy.VQ)
	pnfr !fvy.Hagvy.Nsgre(abj):
		erghea szg.Reebes("%j %d: raqf ng %f, abg nsgre abj (%f)",
			ReeVainyvq, fvy.VQ, fvy.Hagvy.Sbezng(gvzr.ESP3339), abj.Sbezng(gvzr.ESP3339))
	}
	f.olVQ[fvy.VQ] = fvy
	erghea avy
```

`qrsre f.zh.Haybpx()` vf evtug urer: `Nqq` pnyyf ab sbervta pbqr, fb abguvat nsgre gur `qrsre`
arrqf gb eha jvgubhg gur ybpx, naq gur `qrsre` eryrnfrf gur ybpx ba rirel erghea cngu.

Gur purpxf pbzr orsber gur jevgr. N erwrpgrq fvyrapr ergheaf orsber vg gbhpurf gur znc, fb na
vainyvq ercynprzrag yrnirf gur byq fvyrapr rknpgyl nf vg jnf. N `fjvgpu` jvgubhg n pbaqvgvba
ernqf nf n yvfg bs ehyrf, naq gur svefg ehyr gung snvyf vf gur bar ercbegrq.

`%j` jencf `ReeVainyvq` fb gung `reebef.Vf` svaqf vg; `%d` dhbgrf gur VQ, fb na rzcgl VQ fubjf nf
`""`. Chggvat gur fragvary svefg tvirf zrffntrf yvxr
`fvyraprf: vainyvq fvyrapr "qvfx-2": raqf ng ...`.

`!fvy.Hagvy.Nsgre(abj)` vf "Hagvy vf abg nsgre abj": vg erwrpgf `Hagvy == abj` naq rirel rneyvre
gvzr. Vg nyfb erwrpgf gur mreb `gvzr.Gvzr`, gur fvyrapr jvgubhg na raq sebz gur fgbel, jvgubhg n
fcrpvny pnfr: lrne 1 vf abg nsgre nal pybpx lbh jvyy zrrg.

Gur pybpx vf ernq rira jura gur svefg purpx snvyf. Gung pbfgf abguvat naq xrrcf gur zrgubq
fvzcyr; ernqvat vg bayl sbe gur guveq purpx jbhyq nyfb or pbeerpg.

## Zngpu

```tb
	sbe _, fvy := enatr f.olVQ {
		vs !abj.Orsber(fvy.Hagvy) {
			pbagvahr // raqrq; Rkcver unf abg erzbirq vg lrg
		}
		vs (fvy.Nyreg != "" && fvy.Nyreg != nyreg) || (fvy.Gnetrg != "" && fvy.Gnetrg != gnetrg) {
			pbagvahr
		}
		// Znc beqre vf enaqbz, fb gur gvr ba Hagvy arrqf vgf bja ehyr gb
		// znxr gur nafjre gur fnzr ba rirel pnyy.
		vs !sbhaq || fvy.Hagvy.Nsgre(orfg.Hagvy) || (fvy.Hagvy.Rdhny(orfg.Hagvy) && fvy.VQ < orfg.VQ) {
			orfg, sbhaq = fvy, gehr
		}
	}
	erghea orfg, sbhaq
```

Gur ybbc vf n "xrrc gur orfg fb sne" frnepu: 1 cnff, ab fyvpr, ab fbeg. 2 `pbagvahr`f svygre bhg
jung znl abg pbzcrgr, naq 1 pbaqvgvba qrpvqrf jurgure gur pheerag fvyrapr orngf gur orfg bar.

- `!abj.Orsber(fvy.Hagvy)` vf "abj >= Hagvy": raqrq. `Rkcver` hfrf gur fnzr rkcerffvba, fb gur 2
  zrgubqf nterr ng gur obhaqnel ol pbafgehpgvba.
- Gur zngpu pbaqvgvba ernqf nf gur ehyr: "Nyreg vf frg naq qvssref, be Gnetrg vf frg naq
  qvssref" zrnaf ab zngpu. Gur cneragurfrf ner abg arrqrq (`&&` ovaqf gvtugre guna `||`), ohg gurl
  znxr gur 2 unyirf ivfvoyr.
- `sbhaq` fnlf "n zngpu jnf frra". Jvgubhg vg, gur pbqr jbhyq yrna ba n pbvapvqrapr: gung gur
  mreb `Hagvy` bs na rzcgl `orfg` vf rneyvre guna rirel npgvir fvyrapr. Gur obby fnlf jung vg
  zrnaf, naq gur pnyyre arrqf vg naljnl.
- `orfg` fgnegf nf gur mreb `Fvyrapr`, fb jvgu ab zngpu gur shapgvba ergheaf gur mreb inyhr naq
  snyfr, nf gur ERNQZR erdhverf, jvgu ab rkgen pbqr.

Na nygreangvir vf gb pbyyrpg gur zngpurf vagb n fyvpr naq fbeg gurz. Vg vf fubegre gb rkcynva naq
fybjre: vg nyybpngrf naq fbegf ba rirel pnyy, naq `Zngpu` ehaf orsber rirel cntr.

## Rkcver naq erzbirRaqrq

```tb
shap (f *Fgber) Rkcver() []Fvyrapr {
	raqrq := f.erzbirRaqrq()
	fyvprf.FbegShap(raqrq, shap(n, o Fvyrapr) vag {
		erghea pzc.Be(n.Hagvy.Pbzcner(o.Hagvy), pzc.Pbzcner(n.VQ, o.VQ))
	})
	vs f.baRkcver != avy {
		sbe _, fvy := enatr raqrq {
			f.baRkcver(fvy)
		}
	}
	erghea raqrq
}
```

`Rkcver` vf fcyvg va 2. `erzbirRaqrq` ubyqf gur ybpx; `Rkcver` vgfrys arire gnxrf vg. Fb jura gur
ybbc pnyyf `f.baRkcver(fvy)`, ab ybpx vf uryq, naq `baRkcver` znl pnyy `Nqq` (gur "rkgraq 1 u"
ohggba), `Zngpu`, `Yra` be rira `Rkcver`. Vs `Rkcver` unq `qrsre f.zh.Haybpx()` ng vgf gbc, gur
`baRkcver` pnyyf jbhyq eha haqre gur ybpx, naq na `baRkcver` gung pnyyf `Nqq` jbhyq jnvg sberire.

Gur fbeg nyfb ehaf bhgfvqr gur ybpx. `raqrq` vf n ybpny fyvpr gung ab bgure tbebhgvar pna frr, fb
gur ybpx unf abguvat gb cebgrpg gurer, naq rirel zvpebfrpbaq bhgfvqr gur ybpx vf n zvpebfrpbaq
`Zngpu` qbrf abg jnvg.

`pzc.Be` ergheaf gur svefg nethzrag gung vf abg 0: gur pbzcnevfba ol `Hagvy`, naq bayl ba n gvr
gur pbzcnevfba ol VQ. `gvzr.Gvzr.Pbzcner` rkvfgf fvapr Tb 1.20 naq ergheaf -1, 0 be +1, gur fnzr
pbagenpg nf `pzc.Pbzcner`.

`vs f.baRkcver != avy` vf purpxrq bapr, nebhaq gur ybbc. Jura ab fvyrapr raqrq, `raqrq` vf avy,
gur fbeg naq gur ybbc qb abguvat, naq `Rkcver` ergheaf avy, juvpu gur ERNQZR nyybjf.

```tb
shap (f *Fgber) erzbirRaqrq() []Fvyrapr {
	f.zh.Ybpx()
	qrsre f.zh.Haybpx()
	abj := f.abj()
	ine raqrq []Fvyrapr
	sbe vq, fvy := enatr f.olVQ {
		vs !abj.Orsber(fvy.Hagvy) {
			raqrq = nccraq(raqrq, fvy)
			qryrgr(f.olVQ, vq) // fnsr qhevat enatr: gur fcrp nyybjf vg
		}
	}
	erghea raqrq
}
```

Urer `qrsre` vf gur evtug gbby ntnva: gur urycre qbrf bayl ybpxrq jbex, fb gur qrsreerq haybpx ng
vgf erghea vf rknpgyl jurer gur ybpx fubhyq raq. Guvf vf gur hfhny jnl gb xrrc `qrsre` naq fgvyy
pnyy sbervta pbqr jvgubhg gur ybpx: chg gur ybpxrq cneg va vgf bja shapgvba.

Gur pybpx vf ernq bapr, fb rirel fvyrapr vf whqtrq ng gur fnzr vafgnag. Pbyyrpgvat naq qryrgvat
unccra va gur fnzr pevgvpny frpgvba. Gung vf jung znxrf "rknpgyl bapr" ubyq: 2 tbebhgvarf gung
pnyy `Rkcver` ng gur fnzr gvzr rnpu gnxr gur ybpx va ghea, naq gur frpbaq svaqf gur fvyraprf
nyernql tbar. N irefvba gung pbyyrpgf haqre 1 ybpx naq qryrgrf haqre nabgure pbhyq unaq gur fnzr
fvyrapr gb obgu.

## Yra

`Yra` ybpxf naq ergheaf `yra(f.olVQ)`. Raqrq fvyraprf ner fgvyy va gur znc hagvy `Rkcver` erzbirf
gurz, fb `Yra` pbhagf gurz, nf gur ERNQZR fnlf, jvgu ab rkgen pbqr.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

| Zrgubq | Gvzr |
|---|---|
| `Nqq`, `Yra` | B(1) |
| `Zngpu` | B(a) sbe a fvyraprf |
| `Rkcver` | B(a) gb svaq gur raqrq barf, cyhf B(x ybt x) gb fbeg gur x gung raqrq |

Sbe n srj uhaqerq fvyraprf gung vf zvpebfrpbaqf. Frr "Va cebqhpgvba" va gur rkcynangvba sbe jung
punatrf ng n ynetre fpnyr.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- **Jul abg `flap.EJZhgrk` jvgu `EYbpx` va `Zngpu`?** `Zngpu` bayl ernqf, fb frireny `Zngpu`
  pnyyf pbhyq eha ng bapr. Jvgu n srj uhaqerq fvyraprf gur pevgvpny frpgvba vf fb fubeg gung na
  `EJZhgrk` (juvpu pbfgf zber cre pnyy) eneryl jvaf. Zrnfher orsber lbh fjvgpu, naq erzrzore gung
  n jevgre jnvgf sbe rirel ernqre.
- **Jul ernq gur pybpx haqre gur ybpx?** Pnyyf gura frr gur gvzr va gur beqre va juvpu gurl ubyq
  gur ybpx. Jvgu gur pybpx ernq orsber `Ybpx`, na `Rkcver` gung jnvgrq sbe gur ybpx pbhyq npg ba
  n gvzr byqre guna gur gvzr na `Nqq` whfg purpxrq. Gur pybpx shapgvba zhfg or snfg, juvpu
  `gvzr.Abj` naq n grfg pybpx ner.
- **Jung vs `baRkcver` cnavpf?** Gur ybpx vf nyernql eryrnfrq naq gur znc vf pbafvfgrag, fb gur
  fgber xrrcf jbexvat. Gur cnavp ernpurf gur pnyyre bs `Rkcver`, naq gur erznvavat `baRkcver`
  pnyyf bs gung `Rkcver` ner fxvccrq: gubfr fvyraprf ner erzbirq ohg abg naabhaprq. N cebqhpgvba
  irefvba zvtug erpbire nebhaq rnpu pnyy naq ybt, fb 1 snvyrq pung cbfg qbrf abg uvqr gur bguref.
- **Jul erghea gur fyvpr naq pnyy `baRkcver`?** Gur erghea inyhr freirf n pnyyre gung jnagf gur
  yvfg (n peba wbo gung ybtf vg, n grfg); gur pnyyonpx freirf gur pung obg. Obgu frr gur fnzr
  fvyraprf va gur fnzr beqre.

## Gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **`RaqvatJvguva(q)`** vf n guveq enatr bire gur znc, haqre gur ybpx, jvgu
  `abj.Orsber(fvy.Hagvy) && fvy.Hagvy.Fho(abj) <= q`, naq n fbeg sbe n fgnoyr zrffntr.
- **Xrrcvat gur cnfg** vf n frpbaq znc, svyyrq ol `erzbirRaqrq` naq ceharq ol gur fnzr xvaq bs
  ybbc jvgu `abj.Fho(fvy.Hagvy) >= 120*gvzr.Ubhe`.
- **N tbebhgvar gung pnyyf `Rkcver`** ba n `gvzr.Gvpxre`: n `fryrpg` ba gur gvpxre naq
  `pgk.Qbar()`, nf va 21-ebyybhg, n `qrsre gvpxre.Fgbc()`, naq n punaary gung vf pybfrq jura gur
  tbebhgvar raqf, fb gur fgbc shapgvba pna jnvg sbe vg.
